Subject: [PATCH] eval: robust-v1 protocol flags (sensor/action noise, DR,
 reset noise); export sim2sim contract

- eval_fullclip_traj.py: --obs-noise / --action-noise-std / --domain-randomization / --reset-noise / --seed.
  Defaults keep the nominal-v2 protocol byte-for-byte; any flag switches protocol_id to *-robust-v1.
- export_sim2sim_contract.py: writes the compiled nominal MjModel (.mjb) and a JSON contract
  (joint/actuator order, action scale/offset, default pose, solver options) for a CPU MuJoCo closed loop.

Training code (src/) is unchanged relative to 4046330.
